    "about.personaBuyersText": "Kwanyo homes, land, commercial property ki off-plan developments me Uganda, keken kwanyo results me district, area, property type, price, bedrooms ki map location. Kwanyo photos, videos, source ki verification information, floor plans, development progress ki payment details ma keken me cente. Kwanyo promising properties, woko alerts, woko owner, agent or developer, yero Mortgage Finder me affordability guide, ki cente independent legal ki title checks me cente ki pay.",
    "about.personaBuyersCta": "Kwanyo for sale",
    "about.studentsTitle": "Students ki parents",
    "about.personaStudentsText": "Kwanyo student rooms ki hostels me university or campus me keken area, budget, room type ki accommodation filters. Kwanyo photos, video, distance information ki practical details me cente ki security, water, electricity, Wi-Fi, furnishing, sharing arrangements ki payment periods ma provider woko. Students ki parents can kwanyo options, woko alerts, woko hostel or owner, woko viewing ki cente room, route ki payment terms me cente ki commit.",
    "about.personaStudentsCta": "Kwanyo student housing",
    "about.ownersTitle": "Owners ki sellers",
    "about.personaOwnersText": "Cente sale or rental listing me website or woko start me WhatsApp. Yero exact location, price ki payment period, property details, photos ki video, keken yero identity ki contact information ma keken me cente ki review. makaug can yero organise description ki yero me site language system. Listing ma tye me staff review keken evidence ma tye, ki me approval woko enquiries, edit details, remove property ki manage visibility me account. First 7 days tye free; published product price tye ma keken me cente ki private listing me live keken period.",
    "about.personaOwnersCta": "List property",
    "about.brokersTitle": "Lucat wil",
    "about.personaBrokersText": "Register agency or broker account, woko identity ki business details me cente ki review, ki yero profile ma buyers ki owners can kwanyo me broker directory. Manage multiple listings me one account, organise leads ki viewing requests, woko phone or WhatsApp, ki export lead information ma tye. Agent plan yero listings me one subscription, me Featured, Premium ki Boosted options can yero me stock ma tye ma keken visibility. Published badges ki profiles tye subject me makaug verification ki moderation rules.",
    "about.personaBrokersCta": "Coye calo lacat wil",
    "about.businessesTitle": "Biacara",
    "about.personaBusinessesText": "Kacel offices, shops, warehouses, industrial space, land ki development opportunities me location, size, price ki property-type filters. Kwanyo commercial searches, woko new-listing alerts ki woko responsible owner, broker or developer. Property-service companies can register me Marketplace review; agencies ki developers can woko market-intelligence reports or connected websites; ki banks, insurers, suppliers ki other brands can reach active property seekers me makaug advertising placements. Every public listing or business source keken me cente ki check directly ki contract or payment.",
    "about.personaBusinessesCta": "Kwanyo commercial space",
