    "about.personaBuyersCta": "Rindira eby'okuruga",
    "about.studentsTitle": "Abanyeshure n'abakyala",
    "about.personaStudentsText": "Rindira ebyumba by'abanyeshure n'ebibuga ebyegattiddwa ku yunivasite oba ekibuga n'okukoresha eby'okuruga, ekiragiro ky'ensimbi, obwoko bw'ekyumba n'eby'okuruga eby'obuguminkiriza. Reba ebifoto, ebivideo, amakuru g'obugari n'amakuru agafasha ng'okutegereza, amazi, amashanyarazi, Wi-Fi, eby'okushongora, eby'okugabana n'eby'okulipira bwe byatanzwe. Abanyeshure n'abakyala bashobora bika eby'okuruga, bakire ebyokutegereza, bavugane n'ekibuga oba omugaba, bategeka okureeba n'okusuzuma ekyumba, omugga n'eby'okulipira nga batakiriza.",
    "about.personaStudentsCta": "Rindira eby'okuruga by'abanyeshure",
    "about.ownersTitle": "Abagaba n'abagurisha",
    "about.personaOwnersText": "Kora orutambi rw'okutunda oba okuruga ku mukutu ogwa internet oba otangire hino ku WhatsApp. Ongyere ahantu ha nyakuri, ekiragiro ky'okusasula n'ekiro ky'okukora, ebiranga ennyumba, ebifaananyi n'ekifaananyi ky'amavidiyo, hanyuma ongereho oburagiro n'amakuru g'okuhikirebwa. makaug ishobora kugufasha okuhanya eby'okurondora no kubereka hino mu rurimi rw'omukutu. Orutambi rwawe rurindirwa okurebwa n'abakozi okutuusa bwe ruba rutegeerekebwa, kandi bwe ruba rutegeerekebwa, orushobora okuhikiriza ebibuuzo, okurondora eby'okurondora, okurondora ennyumba n'okurondora okureeba ku account yawe. Emyaka 7 ey'okutangira ni ya buntu; ekiragiro ky'okusasula ky'okutunda ky'ekintu ky'ekiragiro ky'okurondora oburungi bwe orutambi rurikukora oburungi obwo.",
    "about.personaOwnersCta": "Rondora ennyumba yawe",
    "about.brokersTitle": "Abakora eby'obutunzi",
    "about.personaBrokersText": "Yandikisha ekibiina ky'obutunzi oba account y'omukora eby'obutunzi, tuma oburagiro n'amakuru g'eky'obutunzi okurebwa, kandi wange profile ey'okurondora abaguzi n'abafunye bashobora kuraba mu directory y'abakora eby'obutunzi. Ogenyere orutambi runyingi ku account emu, hanya ebibuuzo n'okureeba eby'okuraba, sobola okuddamu hino ku phone oba WhatsApp, kandi ongereho amakuru g'ebibuuzo bwangu. Ekiragiro ky'omukora eky'okurondora kirungika orutambi hamwe ku subscription emu, kandi ebirungi bya Featured, Premium na Boosted bishobora gukoreshwa ku by'obutunzi ebikeneye okurabirwa oburungi. Ebibadgi n'ebiprofaili ebyatandikirwaho birindirwa okurebwa n'amategeko g'okugenzura ga makaug.",
    "about.personaBrokersCta": "Yandikisha nga mukora eby'obutunzi",
    "about.businessesTitle": "Ebikora eby'obutunzi",
    "about.personaBusinessesText": "Shakisha ebifo by'obucuruzi, amaka, eby'obugagga, eby'obushobozi bw'okukora, ensi n'ebishoboka eby'okuteekateeka hweho husinga ku kifo, obunene, ekiragiro ky'ennyumba n'ekiragiro ky'ekifo. Bika eby'okushakisha eby'obucuruzi, wakire ebiragiro eby'obushasha eby'okutandika n'okuhamagara omuha omuhozi, omucuruzi oba omuteekateeka. Amakampani agatanga eby'obucuruzi gashobora kwiyandikisha ku makagye ga Marketplace; ebibuga n'abateekateeka bashobora gusaba ebiragiro by'amasoko oba ebibuga eby'okukora; n'amabanki, abakora eby'obwishingizi, abakora eby'obutunzi n'ebindi biguriro bashobora kugera ku bashaka eby'obucuruzi abarikukora binyuze mu makagye ga makaug. Buri ky'okushikiriza oba omuhozi w'obucuruzi kyetaaga okureba ku bwangu mbere y'okukora ekiragiro oba okutuusa omushahara.",
    "about.personaBusinessesCta": "Shakisha eby'obucuruzi",
    "about.stepsTitle": "Okuva ku gushakisha okutuusa ku gutondebwa, mu ntambwe esatu",
    "about.stepSearchTitle": "Shakisha oba ushireho",
    "about.stepSearchText": "Shakisha eby'obucuruzi bya Uganda ku mukutu oba WhatsApp, oba shyira omuhozi gwo n'ebiragiro n'ebifaananyi abantu bakeneye.",
    "about.stepVerifyTitle": "Reba n'okurondora",
    "about.stepVerifyText": "Koresha omuhozi, omuhamagaro, ekifo, ekiragiro n'ebifaananyi okurondora ebishoboka. makaug arondora eby'okushikiriza n'okuraga ebikakasa mbere y'okushikiriza.",
    "about.stepConnectTitle": "Hamagara n'obuhangwa",
    "about.stepConnectText": "Hamagara omuhozi, omucuruzi oba omuteekateeka, tegereza okureeba, kandi ukore ebireeba eby'obwangu mbere y'okusinya oba okutuusa omushahara.",
    "about.landHubTitle": "Obutali bubi bw'ensi",
    "about.landHubText": "Shakisha ensi, urondore ebiragiro, n'okureba engeri y'okuhamagara omutunzi. makaug ni ekibuga ky'obucuruzi, si ekibuga ky'okureeba ebiragiro by'ensi oba eby'amateeka — n'ekyo fata intambwe esatu zokwikira mbere y'okutuusa omushahara.",
    "about.landHubPortal": "Shakisha ensi",
    "about.landHubUgNlis": "Portal ya Official UgNLIS",
    "about.landHubOfficialTitle": "Kushushanya ekibanza",
    "about.landHubOfficialText": "Shushanya ekibanza ekirungi mbere yo kugenda kukireeba.",
    "about.landHubEvidenceTitle": "Reba ebikozesebwa",
    "about.landHubEvidenceText": "Soma ebiranga obutaka n'omuganga w'oburungi, si omu ashaisha obutaka.",
    "about.landHubProcessTitle": "Tegereza obushobozi",
    "about.landHubProcessText": "Tegera kwihutira, kandi otegeire okuteeka ssente eza kutazikirizibwa.",
    "about.safetyLabel": "Okukora n'okutegereza",
    "about.trustTitle": "Engyenda zyaffe okukuuma obujulizi bw'obutaka",
    "about.trustIntro": "Obujulizi bw'obutaka tebushobora gukemurwa n'ekiranga oba okukora okukora kw'ekikora. makaug erimu okushushanya oburungi n'okutegereza ebiranga, ebikozesebwa eby'oburungi, okushushanya eby'oburungi, okushushanya abantu, ebisobyo ebirabika n'ekyokukora okushushanya n'okukuraho. Turinda oburabyo bw'okutegereza okuti ebirungi n'ebiragiro birikurikirwa aho kugenda bikoma.",
    "about.trustIdentityTitle": "Okushushanya oburungi n'okutegereza oburungi",
    "about.trustIdentityText": "Abantu batanga obutaka batanga oburungi n'oburabyo bw'okutegereza. Turikora okushushanya oburungi oburabyo n'okushushanya abantu okushaba ebibuuzo ku butaka. Ebi birinda oburungi, naye si ekiragiro ky'obutaka.",
    "about.trustReviewTitle": "Byarikwetegerezwa mbere y'okuba ku rubuga",
    "about.trustReviewText": "Ebitangwa n'ebiri ku murongo birikwetegerezwa aho kugenda ku rubuga. Ekibiina kirikora okushushanya eby'oburungi, ebiragiro, ekibanza, oburabyo, ebifaananyi, ebikozesebwa n'okushushanya eby'oburungi mbere y'okuragira obutaka bwitegereze.",
    "about.trustDuplicateTitle": "Okushushanya eby'oburungi eby'oburabyo n'ebifaananyi eby'oburungi",
    "about.trustDuplicateText": "Tuhereza ku bintu ebiri ku nkomerero, eby'obutaka, ebirungi, ebihuriro, ebibuga, eby'obushushanyo n'ahari ebishushanyo by'obushushanyo. Ebintu ebirungi oba eby'obushushanyo ebisubirwaho birikwetegerezwa okureeba obugyenyi bwakyo okuti ekintu ekimu tekirikwesebwa nga kyebiri ebintu bibiri eby'enjawulo.",
    "about.trustSourceTitle": "Eby'obutaka n'okuhinduka birikugumaho okureeba",
    "about.trustSourceText": "Ebikozesebwa ku mukutu bigumaho oburongo obwerekana ahari eby'obutaka ebyatandikirwaho. Okusubiramo ebiragiro, okuhindura ebiriho, okuteekateeka, ebiragiro n'okukwata ku byokukuraho birikukozesebwa mu mateka agasoboka okuti ekiro ky'ekyabaye kirikugonderwa kandi kikirikukozesebwa mu buryo bumwe.",
    "about.trustSignalsTitle": "Ebiragiro eby'obujjanjabi n'okukwata",
    "about.trustSignalsText": "Okutegereza obutakireeta, ebibuga ebiriko eby'enjawulo oba ebirungi, eby'obushushanyo ebyasubirwaho, ebihuriro ebiriko eby'obujjanjabi n'okukwata okuteeka ssente mu bwangu oba obutakireeta birikuba ekiragiro okuddamu oba okuteekateeka eby'obutaka. Abakoresha basobola okutangaza ekiragiro kyabwe ku bakozi okureeba.",
    "about.trustClaimTitle": "Okusaba oba okukwata",
    "about.trustClaimText": "Abafunye n'abakora ku butaka basobola okusaba, okuteekateeka, okuteekateeka obutakireeta, oba okukwata eby'obutaka buli kaseera — n'amateka g'okureeba buli kimu.",
    "about.trustFraudTitle": "Okusaba, okuteekateeka, okutangaza oba okukwata",
    "about.trustFraudText": "Abafunye n'abakora ku butaka basobola okusaba eby'obutaka ebyatandikirwaho ku mukutu, okuteekateeka amakuru agatariwo oba okusaba okukwata. Buli muntu asobola okutangaza eby'obujjanjabi. Ekibiina kirikureeba ebiragiro kandi kirisobola okugumya, okugumya, okuteekateeka oba okukwata eby'obutaka buli kaseera ekiragiro kirikureebwa.",
