    "about.everythingTitle": "Byonna byoshoboka okukora",
    "about.personaBuyersText": "Raba amaka, ebibanja, eby'obusuubuzi n'ebikozesebwa eby'obugagga mu Uganda yonna, hanyuma wihitirire ebyo wifuza ku bitundu, eby'obugagga, obugagga bw'ekintu, ebirungi, ebyumba n'ekifo ku katabo. Gereranya ebifoto, ebivideo, amakuru g'okutandikirwaho n'okukakasa, ebiranga ebyumba, obugagga obwateekebwa n'amakuru g'okulipiza bwateekebwa. Zikiriza eby'obugagga eby'obugumu, teekako ebiragiro, ganira omu omu ku by'obugagga, omu ku bakozi oba omu ku bakozi abateekateeka, koresha Mortgage Finder okufuna amakuru g'okulipiza, kandi ukore ebikakasa eby'obulamu n'ebiranga eby'obugagga nga tolipiza.",
