    "about.rentersTitle": "Abakozesa eby'obugagga",
    "about.personaRentersText": "Saka eby'obugagga eby'okukozesebwa n'ekitundu, akatundu, ekikopo, ebiragiro by'ensimbi, ebyumba n'ekika ky'eby'obugagga. Gereranya ebifoto, ebivideo, ebiragiro by'eby'ensimbi, ebiragiro by'eby'obugagga, engeri z'okukozesa, n'eby'okutegereza eby'obugagga nga otandikiriza. Zikiriza eby'obugagga n'ebisaka, wakire ebiragiro bw'eby'obugagga ebikwata, otegereze omu ku mukazi oba omukozi, sobola okwekenura oba okuddamu, n'okukozesa amagezi ga makaug ag'okukuuma obutebenkevu nga otandikira okutuusa ku musango.",
    "about.personaRentersCta": "Saka eby'obugagga eby'okukozesebwa",
    "about.buyersTitle": "Abagura",
    "about.personaOwnersText": "Kora ekiragiro ky'okutunda oba okuruga ku mukutu ogwa intaneti oba otangire n'okukoresha WhatsApp. Ongereza ekifo ekiriwo, ekiragiro ky'ekintu, n'ekiseera ky'okulipira, ebiranga ekintu, ebifaananyi n'ekivideo, oluvannyuma ongeza obutambi n'amakuru g'okukozesa agasaba okunoonyereza. makaug erina okukuza obusobozi bw'okuteeka mu ngeri y'olulimi lw'omukutu. Ekiragiro kyo kikyali ku nteekateeka y'abakozi okutuusa lw'ekiragiro kyakugyibwako, era bw'ekiragiro kyemezebwa osobola okufuna ebibuuzo, okuteekateeka ebiranga, okukyusa, okukkiriza ekintu n'okuteeka ku maaso okuva ku akaunti yo. Ennaku 7 ez'okutandika ziri ku buntu; ekiragiro ky'ekintu ekisindikiddwa kirina okukozesebwa bw'otadde ekiragiro eky'obutali bwa buli muntu ku maaso oluvannyuma lw'ekiseera ekyo.",
    "about.personaOwnersCta": "Teeka ekintu kyo ku lukalala",
    "about.brokersTitle": "Abakola eby'obusuubuzi",
    "about.personaBrokersText": "Yandikisha ekibiina kyo oba akaunti y'omukola eby'obusuubuzi, tuma obutambi n'amakuru g'obusuubuzi okunoonyereza, era wangezza profaili ey'obusobozi abakola eby'obusuubuzi n'abatunda basobola okuyibona mu kitabo ky'abakola eby'obusuubuzi. Teekateeka ebiragiro bingi okuva ku akaunti emu, teekateeka ebibuuzo n'okusaba okw'okulaba, eyinza okuddamu ku mulimu ogwa telefoni oba WhatsApp, era tereka amakuru g'ebibuuzo bw'aliwo. Pulaani y'omukola eby'obusuubuzi etuuka ku biragiro wansi w'ekiragiro kimu, ate eby'okulondoola, eby'obulungi n'ebikozesebwa eby'okuteekateeka bisobola okukozesebwa ku biragiro ebisaba okuba n'obusobozi obw'enjawulo. Ebibadgi ebyasindikibwa n'ebiprofaili bikyali ku mateeka g'okunoonyereza n'okutereeza kwa makaug.",
    "about.personaBrokersCta": "Yandikisha ng'omukola eby'obusuubuzi",
    "about.businessesTitle": "Ebikozesebwa by'obusuubuzi",
    "about.personaBusinessesText": "Shakisha ebifo eby'obusubuzi, amaka g'okutunda, eby'obugagga, eby'obukora, ensi n'amahirwe g'okukuraamu eby'obusubuzi nga okoresa eby'obutonde, obunene, ekiragiro ky'ennyumba n'ekiragiro ky'eby'obusubuzi. Bika eby'obusubuzi eby'obusubuzi, wakire ebiragiro eby'eby'obusubuzi eby'eky'okutandika n'okwegatta n'omukazi ow'obusubuzi, omukozi oba omukora eby'obusubuzi. Amakampuni ag'eby'obusubuzi gasobola kwiyandikisha ku makaug okureeba; amakampuni n'abakora eby'obusubuzi basaba ebireetwa eby'eby'obusubuzi oba ebisomero eby'eby'obusubuzi; n'amabanki, abakola eby'obutale, abakola eby'obusubuzi n'ebindi bisobola okwegatta n'abasaba eby'obusubuzi abali mu makaug. Buli ky'okutunda oba ekisomero ky'obusubuzi kisobola okwetegekebwa nga kyokka nga tekirina kwetegereza obutali bumu nga tebikozesebwa mu nkola oba mu kwetegereza ssente.",
    "about.personaBusinessesCta": "Raba ebifo eby'obusubuzi",
    "about.stepsTitle": "Okuva ku kusaka okutuuka ku kwetegereza, mu ntambwe esatu",
    "about.stepSearchTitle": "Saka oba tunda",
    "about.stepSearchText": "Saka eby'obusubuzi bya Uganda ku mukutu oba WhatsApp, oba tuma eby'obusubuzi byo n'ebikozesebwa ebyetaagibwa.",
    "about.stepVerifyTitle": "Reeba n'okulinganiza",
    "about.stepVerifyText": "Koresa eby'obutonde, omukutu, ekiragiro ky'ennyumba, ekiragiro ky'ennyumba n'ebikozesebwa okulinganiza ebisoboka. makaug eraba eby'obusubuzi n'okulaga ebizibu nga tebikozesebwa.",
    "about.stepConnectTitle": "Gatta obugumu",
    "about.stepConnectText": "Gatta n'omukazi ow'obusubuzi, omukozi oba omukora eby'obusubuzi, tegereza eby'obusubuzi, era weereza ebizibu eby'obutali bumu nga tosinza oba otunda.",
    "about.landHubTitle": "Obutali bubi bw'ensi",
