    "about.landHubProcessTitle": "Tegereza obutakoma",
    "about.landHubProcessText": "Tegera buhoro, kandi totakora ebiripirirwa eby'obutakikozesebwa.",
    "about.safetyLabel": "Okukirizibwa n'obutakoma",
    "about.trustTitle": "Engyendererwa zyaffe okukuuma obutakoma",
    "about.trustIntro": "Obutakoma ku by'obutaka tetushobora kukikiza n'ekibaho oba okukora ekizibu ekimu. makaug yongera okureba obutakoma bw'omuntu n'obutakoma bw'obutakoma, ebiragiro eby'eby'obutakoma, okureba eby'obutakoma eby'obutakoma, okureba eby'obutakoma eby'obutakoma, okureba eby'obutakoma eby'obutakoma, n'okukora eby'obutakoma eby'obutakoma. Tujja tukora eby'obutakoma eby'obutakoma okuti eby'obutakoma n'ebisubizo bisoboka okureberwa obutakoma bw'obutakoma.",
    "about.trustIdentityTitle": "Okureba obutakoma bw'omuntu n'obutakoma bw'obutakoma",
    "about.trustIdentityText": "Abantu abatuza eby'obutaka batanga obutakoma bw'omuntu n'obutakoma bw'obutakoma okureberwa. Tureba nti obutakoma bw'obutakoma bukora kandi nti omuntu asobola okuddamu ebibuuzo ku by'obutaka. Ebyo byongera obutakoma, naye si ekiragiro ky'obutaka.",
    "about.trustReviewTitle": "Byasuzibwa mbere y'okuba eby'obutaka eby'omugaso",
    "about.trustReviewText": "Eby'obutaka ebyatandikirwaho n'eby'obutaka eby'obutaka biva mu kusuzibwa okutuusa ku mukutu ogw'obutaka. Ekibiina kireba eby'obutaka, ebiragiro, ahantu, obutakoma, ebifaananyi, ebiragiro n'obutakoma eby'obutakoma eby'obutakoma mbere y'okugyamu ekiragiro ky'okuba eby'obutaka eby'omugaso.",
    "about.trustDuplicateTitle": "Okureba eby'obutakoma eby'obutakoma n'ebifaananyi eby'obutakoma",
    "about.trustDuplicateText": "Tuhwanye ebihuriraho eby'obusoko, ebiranga eby'obutaka, ebirangirizi, ebifo, eby'okutegeka n'amaso, n'obushushanyo obuboneka. Ebihuriraho oba eby'okukozesebwa ebyongera biba byerekanwa okureba bulungi okuti ekibanza tekirangirwe nga ky'enjawulo mu bintu bingi.",
    "about.trustSourceTitle": "Ebisoko n'ebyokuhinduka biraguma bisoboka okubyigirizaho",
    "about.trustSourceText": "Ebikozesebwa ku mukutu biguma n'ekiraro ku busoko obw'eky'okubiri. Okusubiramo ebyemezo, ebyokuhindura obuzibu, okutuukiriza, ebikakasa n'okukwata ebikozesebwa biba mu ngeri eyandikiddwa okuti ekipe esobore okureba ebyabaye n'okukora mu ngeri ey'enjawulo.",
    "about.trustSignalsTitle": "Ebiranga obujjanjabi n'okukwata ku bantu",
    "about.trustSignalsText": "Okukakasa obutali bumu ku busobozi, ebifo ebirwanirira oba ebiragiro, eby'okukozesebwa ebyakopiibwa, ebirangirizi eby'obujjanjabi n'okukwata ku muntu okutuusa ku kwetegereza oba okutuusa ku kwetegereza okw'obutali bumu biri mu bintu ebyetaaga okuddamu okureba oba okutegeka ekibanza. Abakoresha basobola okutanga ekireetera okukakasa ku bakozi.",
    "about.trustClaimTitle": "Kakasa oba ggyako",
    "about.trustClaimText": "Abafunze n'abakora ku butaka basobola okukakasa, okutegeka, okutuukiriza, oba okuggyako ekibanza buli kaseera — n'okugenda mu ngeri eyandikiddwa ey'okureba.",
    "about.trustFraudTitle": "Kakasa, tegeka, tanga ekireetera oba ggyako",
    "about.trustFraudText": "Abafunze n'abakora ku butaka basobola okukakasa ekibanza ekibadde ku mukutu, okutegeka amakuru agatalina kutegekerwa oba okusaba okuggyako. Buli omu asobola okutanga ekireetera eky'obujjanjabi. Ekipe eraba ebiraga era esobola okugumira, okugumira, okutegeka oba okuggyako ebikozesebwa bw'ekireetera kireberwa.",
    "about.trustBoundary": "Ebikora byo kwikora byoona birikurikirana: okureba kwa makaug kugabanya oburungi obutakenewe naye tekusimbura okureeba kw'omubiri, omunyamateeka ow'obwigenge, okushakisha ebiragiro eby'obutale, ekiragiro ekyandikiddwa oba enkora y'okulipwa ey'okushoborora. Tewalipanga kubanga omuntu akusaba okukora kyangu.",
