    "about.discoveryYoutubeText": "Ekyetegereza makaug okuraba ebifaananyi by'obutaka obuli mu bifo eby'obugagga mu Uganda n'okubona ebikozesebwa okuva mu makubo agakwata ku butaka nga ekifaananyi eky'eky'okubiri kikyusibwa n'okukwata ku kyapa ekiraga obutaka obwo.",
    "about.discoveryXTitle": "X API — kyali Twitter",
    "about.discoveryXText": "Ekyetegereza kutuyamba okuraba ebipande eby'obutaka eby'obugagga n'okugumya ekyapa eky'okubiri, akawunti n'ekirooto okusobola okureeba abantu ekibanza eky'eby'okubiri kyavaamu amakuru.",
    "about.discoveryTikTokTitle": "TikTok API",
    "about.discoveryTikTokText": "Ekyetegereza kutuyamba okuraba ebifaananyi by'obutaka eby'obugagga okuva mu bifo eby'obugagga n'okukwata buli kyapa eky'obutaka ku kyapa eky'okubiri ekyava mu TikTok.",
    "about.discoveryGoogleTitle": "Google APIs",
    "about.discoveryGoogleText": "Ekyetegereza kutuyamba okuraba amapeji agakwata ku butaka obuli mu bifo eby'obugagga n'okutegeera ebifo, ebifo by'amamepu, ebifo by'amazu n'ebifo by'eby'obugagga. Ekifo eky'okubiri kikyusibwa buli kifo eky'obutaka ekyabonetse ku mukutu.",
    "about.discoveryStepOneTitle": "Kora ekyapa eky'obutaka eky'okubiri",
    "about.discoveryStepOneText": "Obutaka obubonetse ku mukutu busaba okukwata ku kyapa eky'obutaka eky'okubiri, ekyifaananyi oba ekifo ekyavaamu — si kyapa ky'okukora okusaka oba akawunti y'omuntu.",
    "about.discoveryStepTwoTitle": "Soma n'okuteeka mu nteekateeka ebiraga obutaka",
    "about.discoveryStepTwoText": "Tukola ku bintu ebyava mu kyapa eky'obutaka: erinnya, ekifaananyi, ekifo, obutaka, ekifo, ebiranga, ebifaananyi, omwanditsi n'ekirooto eky'okubiri. Ebintu ebyetaaga okutegeerekebwa tebiriwo oba bituukirizibwa okutegeerekebwa.",
    "about.discoveryStepThreeTitle": "Soma n'okugereranya ebiranga n'ebisubizo eby'enjawulo",
    "about.discoveryStepThreeText": "Tugereranya ekyapa, ekifo, ekifo, ebiranga, ebifaananyi, n'ebifaananyi okuteeka ku kyapa eky'obutaka eky'enjawulo oba eky'enjawulo nga tetukirizibwa okutuuka ku mukutu.",
    "about.discoveryStepFourTitle": "Okusuzuma kwa muntu nga tannaba kukola ku mukutu",
