    "advertise.package.creative_design_addon.copy": "makaug ahindura ekirango kyo ekyemereire, ebiragiro n'omugambo gwo mu bishushanyo eby'okukora eby'obugabe oburungi obutegeddwa obugumire. Kino ky'ekikozesho ky'okuronga ekirungi era tekirimu kwetegereza eby'okukora eby'obugabe ku bwakyo.",
    "advertise.package.creative_design_addon.locations": "Ekishushanyo kya Banner|Ekishushanyo kya Listing|Ekikozesho ky'okuronga eky'okugyamu obugabe",
    "advertise.package.creative_design_addon.bestFor": "Abakora ebyokukora abali n'ebiragiro n'ebikozesho by'ekirango naye beetaaga ebishushanyo eby'obugabe eby'oburungi n'ebirungi nga bitandikirwa.",
