    "about.discoveryStepTwoText": "Tukola ku bikwata ku by'ekika: ekifaananyi, ekifaananyi, ekifo, ekifo ky'obugagga, ekifo, ebifo by'okukwatagana, eby'obugagga, omuwandiisi n'ennaku eyawandiikibwa okusinga. Ebikwata ebyetaagisa bisigala tebiriwo oba bisindikiddwa okutuukiriza.",
