    "about.discoveryStepFourTitle": "Okusoma kwa muntu nga tannaba kusindikibwa",
    "about.personaBuyersText": "Laba amaka, ettaka, eby'obusuubuzi n'ebikolebwa ku nteekateeka mu Uganda yonna, oluvannyuma weereza ebiva mu disitulikiti, ekifo, omutindo gw'ekintu, ssente, ebyumba eby'obulamu n'ekifo ku katabo. Ggyako ebifaananyi, ebifaananyi eby'amaanyi, amakulu agava mu kifo n'okukakasa, ebikozesebwa ku ntebe, obutereevu bw'okukola n'amawulire g'okulipira bwe byeyatwalibwa. Weereza ebintu eby'enjawulo, weereza ebikozesebwa, wuliriza omukazi, omukozi oba omukola, kozesanga Mortgage Finder okufuna amagezi ku ssente ezikwata ku kifo, era weereza okunoonyereza okw'obulamu n'okukakasa obutereevu nga toyinza kulipira.",
